		<td class="title"><i>Greetings friends, family, and adventurers!<p>
Welcome to the humble home of the Holy Order of Tunare, an established guild on the server Bristlebane, on the MMORPG, EverQuest. The Holy Order of Tunare has been alive and well since September 1999, so you are entering the halls where strong ties of family and friendship beat true in our blood.
Come on in, make yourself at home, and spend some time with all of us. Visitors are always welcome into our home, and you are no exception. Take some time to look around, chat with us, and get to know us better. We surely would like to know you! 
<p>May the blessings of Tunare follow you in your journeys. We do hope you will come and see us again!
<p>
Warmest regards,<br>
Lady Siniana D’artanian<br>
Earl Marshall, Holy Order of Tunare
		</i></td>
